w" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ISHIKAWA KENICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HASHIMOTO, HIDEYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHIKAWA, KENICHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A door for vehicle, wherein a guide member forming a lifting mechanism which guides a carrier plate fitted to a window pane is fixedly mounted on at least either of first and second sashes beforehand so as to form a module in which the window pane, lifting mechanism, and first and second sashes are formed integrally with a base plate and the module is installed on a door main body, whereby an assembly process can be facilitated without obstructing the lifting up and down of the window pane.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Portière de véhicule dans laquelle un élément de guidage, formant un mécanisme de levage qui guide une plaque support fixée sur une vitre, est monté préalablement sur le premier et/ou le second châssis mobile, de façon à constituer un module où la vitre, le mécanisme de levage et le premier et le second châssis sont formés en monobloc avec une plaque de base. Le module est monté sur le corps principal de la portière, ce qui facilite l'opération d'assemblage sans gêner la montée et la descente de la vitre.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_l